      "widgets_values": [
        "THREE SCENES \u2014 same bar, same couple\n\n1. Queue Prompt. Scene 1 (hug at the bar) is txt2img and is the master.\n   Scene 2 img2img with IPAdapter + Depth (keep the bar).\n   Scene 3 img2img with IPAdapter only \u2014 POV comes from the checkpoint prompt.\n\n2. When you like scene 1: set its seed to fixed (or Load Image the PNG),\n   mute scene 1 KSampler if you only want 2/3, keep room + people CLIP frozen.\n\n3. Edit only the three ACTION prompt boxes. Do not change Room or People.\n\nControlNet Depth is used for the sofa scene only.\nIPAdapter: Unified Loader preset PLUS (high strength).\n\nDenoise: hug 1.0 / sofa 0.50 / POV 0.60.\n"
      ],
